      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "§6Machine type: §aOre Processor§r\n\nEngineering is the art of directing the great sources of power in nature for the use and convenience of man.\nThe ores will line up and go in through the entrance and out through the exit.\nThis machine will not do overclock. Progress time is always 6.4s (default).\nIt will process as many inputs as possible at once, if power allow.\nConsume 3200L Lubricant every 12.8s (default).\nJoining the wireless EU network when without installing an energy hatch.\nNon-ore inputs will be transferred to the output bus.\n\n[note]Hatches[/note]: Input Bus, Input Hatch, Output Bus, Energy Hatch\n[note]Structure[/note]: Tiered glass (limits the energy hatch tier); Tungsten Steel Frame Boxes; the casings in the optional task.\nUse a Hologram Projector (or the NEI structure preview) to see and auto-build the structure.\n\n[note]Controller recipe[/note]: Assembly Line, UEV\nResearch item: Integrated Ore Factory\n - 64x Cosmic Neutronium Frame Box\n - 64x Integrated Ore Factory\n - 64x UIV Circuit\n - 64x Neutronium Rotor\n - 64x Electric Motor UEV\n - 16x Electric Pump UEV\n - 16x Conveyor Module UEV\n - 16x Robot Arm UEV\n - 16x Neutronium Nanites\n - 16x Infinity Huge Pipe\n - 64x Neutronium Dense Plate\n - 64x Iridium Dense Plate\n - 64x Stainless Steel Dense Plate\n - 64x EM Power\n - 64x Superconductor UEV 16x Wire\n - 73,728 L Solder plasma\n - 147,456 L Molten Tungsten Steel\n - 147,456 L Molten Neutronium\n - 147,456 L Molten Osmiridium",
